      "relevant_text": [
        "--download",
        "--rerun",
        "This command combines the effect of the @|bold codeql database run-queries|@ and @|bold codeql database interpret-results|@ commands. If you want to run queries whose results @|italic don't|@ meet the requirements for being interpreted as source-code alerts, use @|bold codeql database run-queries|@ or @|bold codeql query run|@ instead, and then @|bold codeql bqrs decode|@ to convert the raw results to a readable notation."
      ]
